# A0': every switch at its default again, after the rolling restart (noted in the record).
# The eviction keeps the rule that every arm starts its persist comparison from an evicted cache;
# drop the host line for a plain control.
# Must show the drift bound: when commit us/tx moved more than 15 % against A0, only adjacent arms
# are compared.
name a0-prime
host evict-mdbx
